        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Global ED-VR331, Crash Bar Vertical Rod Door Exit Device</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis crash bar style surface vertical rod panic device is the perfect choice for double doors without mullions, doors with glass and doors that are not flat. Suitable for most medium to wide stile doors (aluminum, hollow metal, or wood), durable enough for most applications.</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThese vertical rod exit devices are <b>non-handed, reversible for right or left hand doors up to 36\" wide and 7 feet tall.</b> The 30\" long, 1\" diameter round cross bar can be field sized to accommodate narrow doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor wider doors use <a href=\"/products/wide-door-crash-bar-vertical-rod-door-exit-device-global-ed-vr331-48\"><b>ED-VR331-48 Wide Door Crash Bar</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>Specifications:</b> for Global ED-VR331\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Latch: Top Interlocking type, Bottom pullman type</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-5/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Height: 7-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: 1\" diameter round steel cross bar, stainless steel springs, wrought steel & pressure cast chassis - Painted </li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/16\" from edge of door to center line of device</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Stile: 3\" minimum for 36\" wide door</li>\r\n<li>Handing: Non Handed (Reversible for Left or Right Hand Doors) </li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Width: Up to 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Height: 7' standard. Add <a href=\"/products/12-inch-vertical-rod-extension-glo-ed-rod331\"><b>1 Foot Extension</b></a> for 8' doors.</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Height: Recommended installation at 40-5/16\" from floor to center line</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: Furnished with sheet metal, machine screws and shoulder mounting studs with set screws</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder: Optional <a href=\"/products/rim-cylinder-lock-global-th1100-rc\"><b>Rim Cylinder</b></a> or <a href=\"/products/high-security-rim-cylinder-with-horizontal-tail-piece-mul-t-lock-206sp-rim1ht-xx\"><b>Mul-T-Lock High Security Rim Cylinder</b></a></li>\r\n<li>Dogging: No</li>\r\n<li>Grade 2</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Manufactures Warranty: 1 Year</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Exterior Trim:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/rim-cylinder-lock-global-th1100-rc\">Rim Cylinder Lock</a>: Night Latch Function (ANSI F03) - Unlatch (Open) door from exterior with Key. Key removable only when locked.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/high-security-rim-cylinder-with-horizontal-tail-piece-mul-t-lock-206sp-rim1ht-xx\">High Security Rim Cylinder</a>: Night Latch Function (ANSI F03) - Unlatch (Open) door from exterior with Key. Key removable only when locked.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/narrow-escutcheon-plate-classroom-lever-for-panic-device-pdq-4-en-08-phl\">Escutcheon Plate Keyed Classroom Lever</a>: Classroom Function (ANSI F08) - Outside lever locked and unlocked by Key. Escutcheon Plate (1-1/2\" wide x 6-7/8\" high) with ADA compliant Lever.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>\r\n***This item is DISCONTINUED.  Only (1) aluminum left in stock. ***\r\n</b></p>",
            "seo": {
